#!/usr/bin/env sh

cat <<'EOF'
iron-file development commands

Environment
  nix develop              Enter the development shell.
  direnv allow             Allow the repository .envrc; adds scripts/ to PATH.

Run
  run                      Start the default Iced frontend.
  run-gtk                  Start the GTK4 frontend.
  run-backend              Start the backend only.

The frontends start the backend automatically when it is not already running.

Cargo
  cargo check --workspace  Type-check every workspace crate.
  cargo test --workspace   Run the workspace tests.
  cargo build --workspace  Build every workspace crate.
  cargo fmt                Format Rust source files.
  cargo fmt --check        Check Rust formatting without changing files.

Nix
  nix develop              Open the development shell without direnv.
  nix flake check          Evaluate and check the development flake.

Run this help again with: scripts/help
EOF
